WEBVTT

00:18.810 --> 00:22.510
<i>Gokusen</i>

00:22.780 --> 00:28.020
<i>How long has it been</i>
<i>since that day when we first met?</i>

00:28.160 --> 00:33.690
<i>So many good times and bad times</i>
<i>have come and gone since then.</i>

00:33.860 --> 00:39.060
<i>I know you can't make sense</i>
<i>of what I'm trying to say.</i>

00:39.230 --> 00:44.500
<i>But my true feelings for you</i>
<i>can never be put into words.</i>

00:44.810 --> 00:50.250
<i>Will you ever know how I feel? Will you</i>
<i>ever know what's going on inside me?</i>

00:50.450 --> 00:55.880
<i>If only we could live in a world where</i>
<i>you only have to be yourself and smile.</i>

00:56.050 --> 01:01.290
<i>Or is it always going to be like this?</i>
<i>Will we be able to go on like this?</i>

01:01.520 --> 01:09.230
<i>Even if you're far away, I want to</i>
<i>feel you in my heart, close to me.</i>

01:51.440 --> 01:56.400
<i>SCHOOL IN THE CROSSHAIRS!</i>

02:00.350 --> 02:03.320
I heard they got Tanaka
from our class this time!

02:03.420 --> 02:04.910
Huh? No way!

02:05.290 --> 02:07.690
How many victims does that make?

02:07.820 --> 02:10.990
Let's see, one, two, three...

02:11.090 --> 02:14.930
Uchiyama, I'm proud of you.
Studying math?

02:16.700 --> 02:19.220
Yankumi! Don't sneak up on us like that!

02:19.330 --> 02:21.200
What happened to Tanaka?

02:21.300 --> 02:22.240
Huh?

02:22.570 --> 02:25.630
Uh, nothing,
just that he's not in today!

02:25.810 --> 02:27.610
Do you know why?

02:27.710 --> 02:31.510
Uh, he fell, and
hurt himself or something!

02:31.650 --> 02:35.210
Don't tell me you've been
fighting with the seniors again...

02:35.320 --> 02:37.290
Hell no! I swear we're not!

02:37.490 --> 02:39.110
You better not be...

02:39.250 --> 02:41.690
If you're B.S.-ing me,
there'll be hell to pay!

02:41.820 --> 02:43.310
What the hell?

02:43.420 --> 02:46.120
It's not the seniors, I'm telling you!

02:46.260 --> 02:47.130
Right?

02:56.200 --> 02:58.260
This is really going to work, right?

02:58.370 --> 03:00.000
Don't believe us?

03:00.180 --> 03:02.580
In that case, the deal's off.

03:02.980 --> 03:04.780
All right, I'll pay!

03:05.350 --> 03:07.910
As long as we're clear. Here you go.

03:08.050 --> 03:11.350
Spread the word to
all your little friends, okay?

03:11.490 --> 03:12.480
See ya!

03:15.420 --> 03:17.690
100 bucks...for this?

03:18.390 --> 03:21.160
I can't believe you
actually paid for that thing!

03:21.260 --> 03:23.820
But they say that
as long as you have this on...

03:23.930 --> 03:27.060
...you won't get attacked,
even if you go to Shirokin High.

03:27.170 --> 03:28.530
What a moron!

03:28.640 --> 03:31.110
Don't fall for a bullshit story
like that...

03:31.270 --> 03:33.470
I bet it's nothing but a scam!

03:33.740 --> 03:35.070
Meow!

03:39.410 --> 03:40.710
Meow!

03:56.260 --> 03:58.500
Crap, they got us!

03:58.600 --> 04:00.360
Damn, that hurts...

04:01.800 --> 04:05.570
I heard that two seniors were
attacked by cats last night!

04:05.670 --> 04:07.010
Jeez, are you serious...

04:07.110 --> 04:09.040
You mean those guys in masks?

04:09.140 --> 04:13.100
There was another kid who had a badge,
and they left him alone.

04:13.210 --> 04:14.110
Badge?

04:14.380 --> 04:16.850
The "Good Luck Maneki Neko" Badge!

04:16.950 --> 04:17.610
Huh?

04:17.820 --> 04:19.080
No way!

04:19.790 --> 04:20.650
Huh?

04:31.630 --> 04:34.760
What is that,
some kind of good luck charm?

04:34.940 --> 04:37.930
Some of these trends don't
make any damned sense...

04:39.170 --> 04:40.540
You wanted to see me?

04:40.640 --> 04:41.840
Mmm...

04:42.010 --> 04:42.500
Huh?

04:43.380 --> 04:46.350
I don't know why,
but it's really intense in here.

04:46.450 --> 04:49.010
Oh, you came at a good time.

04:49.350 --> 04:51.410
What? At a good time?

04:51.550 --> 04:55.790
Check this out. This badge.
How many have you seen here today?

04:55.960 --> 04:57.480
Oh, this thing?

04:57.830 --> 05:00.950
Everyone seems to be wearing one.

05:01.300 --> 05:02.990
Too many for me to count.

05:03.800 --> 05:06.770
Is there a problem with that badge?

05:07.470 --> 05:10.030
Do you want to guess how much it costs?

05:10.140 --> 05:11.400
Hmm, I'd say...

05:12.140 --> 05:13.440
...two dollars, maybe?

05:13.540 --> 05:14.940
Try 100 dollars!

05:15.040 --> 05:16.480
Huh...what?

05:16.880 --> 05:19.310
100 dollars? For this?

05:19.750 --> 05:23.710
We're getting all sorts of complaints
that the students are taking money from...

05:23.850 --> 05:27.340
...their parents' wallets or stealing
from their sisters to buy this badge.

05:27.420 --> 05:29.290
So it's that popular?

05:29.520 --> 05:30.650
Come on!

05:31.190 --> 05:35.320
Mr. Iwamoto thinks that gangsters might
be behind this, or something like that.

05:35.430 --> 05:37.230
G-gangsters!

05:37.330 --> 05:38.800
Well, think about it!

05:38.900 --> 05:41.600
Do you have any idea how much
money we're talking about?

05:41.700 --> 05:44.800
Besides, they're telling the kids
that if they don't have this badge...

05:44.910 --> 05:46.640
...they'll be attacked by cats.

05:46.740 --> 05:49.610
If that's not blackmail,
I don't know what is!

05:49.710 --> 05:51.110
Uh...

05:51.250 --> 05:53.240
Attacked by cats?

05:54.180 --> 05:58.590
No self-respecting yakuza would be
caught dead pulling a stunt like that!

05:58.690 --> 06:00.450
Yes, you're right...

06:00.590 --> 06:01.650
Well...

06:02.290 --> 06:05.320
The possibility just crossed my mind...

06:06.160 --> 06:07.860
Then who the heck...

06:09.730 --> 06:10.660
Don't worry!

06:10.830 --> 06:14.960
I'm sure it's not yakuza-related...
Nothing as sordid as that! Really!

06:15.070 --> 06:16.730
You really think so?

06:17.000 --> 06:20.810
Well, I have to get ready for my next class.
See you later...

06:21.640 --> 06:27.810
Using strong-arm tactics to try to make
a killing off virtually worthless goods...

06:28.420 --> 06:31.820
Smells every which way
like a gangster's racket.

06:32.520 --> 06:33.780
A cat badge?

06:34.020 --> 06:36.750
Uh-huh. Know anything about it?

06:36.890 --> 06:39.050
Don't ask me, for chrissake...

06:47.440 --> 06:51.700
Someone's been selling them
behind the train station.

06:51.870 --> 06:56.240
Behind the train station?
That area's the Tenkai Group's territory.

06:56.480 --> 06:57.500
Yamaguchi...

06:57.810 --> 06:59.080
You're not gonna...

06:59.650 --> 07:00.550
Thanks!

07:00.720 --> 07:04.680
From now on,
this has nothing to do with you.

07:11.660 --> 07:12.560
Fuji!

07:12.890 --> 07:16.830
Hey, don't follow me.
We're not out on a walk today.

07:19.070 --> 07:21.870
Must you speak to me so coldly?

07:21.970 --> 07:24.870
I can tell by your eyes
that something's up...

07:24.970 --> 07:30.840
I may not be much help to you, but I shall
follow you through hell and high water!

07:32.880 --> 07:36.080
<i>Tenkai Group</i>

07:36.220 --> 07:38.380
Fuji, I want you to wait here.

07:39.690 --> 07:40.990
Ojou!

07:44.290 --> 07:46.260
Hey, what's the big idea?

07:46.430 --> 07:49.420
Sweetheart, you can't just
bust in here like that!

07:49.530 --> 07:51.090
I called out to you a few times...

07:51.200 --> 07:53.760
...but I guess you were laughing
so you didn't hear me.

07:53.900 --> 07:56.770
I'd like to speak to
Tenkai Kumicho, please...

07:57.040 --> 07:59.600
HUH? What the hell, you little...

08:02.740 --> 08:06.040
Hey! If it isn't the young Ojou
from the Ooedo Group!

08:06.150 --> 08:07.340
W-what?

08:08.150 --> 08:11.280
I'll take you to the Kumicho right away.
This way, please!

08:23.600 --> 08:24.620
Um...

08:24.800 --> 08:25.790
Yes?

08:26.370 --> 08:31.330
Don't tell me Uncle Tenkai's gotten
hooked on something strange again...

08:31.710 --> 08:34.770
Yes, you're right on the money.

08:35.340 --> 08:39.370
You see, if you laugh with
all your might, it brings good luck.

08:39.510 --> 08:42.010
It's starting to drive us crazy...

08:42.120 --> 08:44.520
Well, I feel your pain...

08:45.090 --> 08:49.050
This is the spot...
put all your strength in this area...

08:54.760 --> 08:57.460
Well! Very impressive, Doctor!

08:57.570 --> 09:01.830
If you laugh that hard, good fortune
will come to you naturally.

09:02.000 --> 09:03.030
I see!

09:03.940 --> 09:05.530
Excuse me, Boss...

09:05.710 --> 09:06.800
What is it?

09:06.970 --> 09:10.540
I told you I wasn't to be
disturbed during Sensei's visit!

09:10.680 --> 09:14.310
Actually, the young lady
from the Ooedo Group is here.

09:14.480 --> 09:16.750
I'm sorry to drop by so suddenly.

09:16.850 --> 09:19.050
Well! Kumi, eh?

09:19.190 --> 09:23.720
Since you have company, I'll be leaving.
Please excuse me.

09:23.960 --> 09:25.550
But Sensei...

09:25.660 --> 09:26.990
It's fine!

09:37.770 --> 09:39.930
That's pretty good!

09:43.010 --> 09:44.770
What the hell?

09:45.380 --> 09:51.380
Are you telling me some amateur punks
are pulling that kind of crap on my turf?

09:51.520 --> 09:53.490
People are getting hurt, as well.

09:54.820 --> 09:57.490
So you had no idea after all...

09:58.290 --> 10:01.190
How dare they do this
right under my nose?

10:01.300 --> 10:02.290
Uncle Tenkai...

10:02.460 --> 10:05.960
Would it be all right
if I looked into this matter?

10:06.200 --> 10:10.330
Since they seem to be
targeting the kids at my school...

10:10.470 --> 10:14.340
Well, even if I told you
we'd take care of it ourselves...

10:14.480 --> 10:17.000
...you wouldn't back off anyway.

10:17.240 --> 10:19.210
Thank you very much!

10:19.350 --> 10:21.080
Just one thing, Kumi...

10:21.220 --> 10:24.150
Promise me you won't do
anything dangerous, all right?

10:24.250 --> 10:25.050
All right.

10:30.930 --> 10:33.590
Ojou! I've been waiting for your return!

10:33.960 --> 10:35.190
Let's go, Fuji!

10:35.330 --> 10:36.890
All right, then...

10:39.800 --> 10:42.100
Isn't that Ms. Yamaguchi?

10:42.400 --> 10:45.030
What was she doing in a place like this?

10:48.280 --> 10:51.910
I'd better get to the bottom of this...

10:52.450 --> 10:56.350
Suspicious guys, suspicious guys,
where are they?

10:56.520 --> 10:59.080
Are we looking for suspicious guys?

10:59.220 --> 11:00.240
<i>Shirokin Station</i>
The station...

11:00.390 --> 11:03.850
Behind the train station...
that's what he said, right?

11:07.400 --> 11:10.260
But the thing is, just
"behind the train station"...

11:10.360 --> 11:12.660
That's not enough to go on.

11:13.870 --> 11:17.460
I don't know what we can do...

11:19.710 --> 11:23.770
Sitting around like that's not
gonna get you anywhere...

11:23.940 --> 11:25.000
Shin...

11:25.350 --> 11:29.680
For chrissake, it's always
hit-or-miss with you, isn't it...

11:29.820 --> 11:32.340
You're butting in where
you're not needed again!

11:32.450 --> 11:36.080
Sure, since you always come up
with these wild schemes...

11:36.220 --> 11:38.390
Some punks are secretly doing...

11:38.530 --> 11:42.490
...business with high school kids
on another clan's turf. Right?

11:42.660 --> 11:43.790
More or less.

11:44.000 --> 11:47.960
You're not gonna find out jack if
you go around asking people yourself.

11:48.100 --> 11:51.070
They never show themselves
unless it's to a client.

11:51.370 --> 11:53.400
This fellow's sharp as a knife!

11:53.570 --> 11:56.540
Only Shirokin students have
been buying the badge so far.

11:56.680 --> 11:59.810
They haven't taken their business
to any of the other schools.

11:59.950 --> 12:02.080
That's all I've been able to find out.

12:03.550 --> 12:05.450
Sawada, what are you saying?

12:05.590 --> 12:09.850
I'll be your decoy. You like
sting operations, don't you?

12:09.990 --> 12:11.460
Hold it, Shin!

12:13.630 --> 12:14.420
Hey!

12:14.760 --> 12:15.630
Look here!

12:15.830 --> 12:20.830
You must be out of your mind! I can't
ask my student to do something like that!

12:21.000 --> 12:22.470
You need to chill.

12:22.670 --> 12:24.800
You're gonna blow our cover.

12:25.340 --> 12:27.470
Don't worry. Just wait here!

12:35.120 --> 12:38.250
In one hour, you got that?
Don't be late.

12:38.490 --> 12:39.320
Gotcha.

12:39.450 --> 12:42.790
If you don't show up with
the dough, the cats will come.

12:42.860 --> 12:44.330
Do you understand?

12:44.430 --> 12:45.290
Yeah.

12:49.400 --> 12:52.530
Those two are the ones
selling the badges.

12:54.570 --> 12:59.560
I told them I'd meet them under
the rails in an hour to buy a badge.

12:59.710 --> 13:00.870
You little...

13:01.040 --> 13:04.010
You knew to come here
from the start, didn't you?

13:04.150 --> 13:06.770
Yeah, well, I've heard
a lot of rumors, you know.

13:06.910 --> 13:09.750
Anyway, this is where I take over.

13:09.850 --> 13:10.550
Huh?

13:10.950 --> 13:13.480
Go on, get yourself home!

13:14.220 --> 13:15.190
Yeah, but...

13:15.720 --> 13:17.490
How're you gonna...

13:25.400 --> 13:26.130
Huh?

13:27.540 --> 13:29.060
Okay...

13:30.240 --> 13:31.470
Mr. Miyata?

13:31.640 --> 13:33.940
Ueno and Haraguchi are here.

13:35.340 --> 13:36.570
Excuse us.

13:36.810 --> 13:40.210
Yo, what's up? Doing a lot of business?

13:40.380 --> 13:42.110
Yeah, business is booming.

13:42.250 --> 13:43.580
Piece of cake, man.

13:43.720 --> 13:44.780
Yeah?

13:45.020 --> 13:47.580
The Boss will be happy to hear that.

13:47.720 --> 13:51.890
We thought we'd make a killing off
these "Fortune-beckoning" cat badges...

13:52.030 --> 13:54.890
...as Nekomata goods,
but they didn't sell.

13:55.030 --> 13:58.990
Brilliant idea of yours to sell off
all our dead stock like this.

14:01.240 --> 14:05.200
For chrissake, those Shirokin losers!
Who knew it would go this well!

14:05.310 --> 14:10.750
They're total idiots. They're retards,
they're morons! Shitheads!

14:10.850 --> 14:11.970
Kudoh...

14:12.110 --> 14:14.950
You really seem to have it in
for that school.

14:15.050 --> 14:16.810
Did something happen?

14:20.920 --> 14:22.790
What are you doing, dumbass?

14:22.890 --> 14:25.880
Didn't I tell you to keep
watch outside, for chrissake?

14:30.360 --> 14:32.130
Who the hell are you?

14:32.270 --> 14:33.460
Hey!

14:33.770 --> 14:36.130
You're that teacher-bitch from...

14:36.700 --> 14:38.640
I know you. You're...

14:39.570 --> 14:40.800
Who are you?

14:40.910 --> 14:44.470
It's Kudoh!
Don't tell me you've forgotten!

14:44.610 --> 14:48.210
You got expelled from Shirokin,
but kept making trouble...

14:48.350 --> 14:50.650
So I had to kick your butt...

14:51.520 --> 14:54.510
Oh, you mean THAT Kudoh?

14:54.860 --> 14:56.520
Crap!

14:56.660 --> 14:58.490
So that's what it is...

14:58.630 --> 15:01.460
You're a pathetic sonofabitch,
aren't you?

15:01.600 --> 15:04.930
Now I see. If you're here, that means...

15:05.070 --> 15:08.870
...it's gotta be the Nekomata Group,
that's behind this scam.

15:09.240 --> 15:10.330
What the hell?

15:10.440 --> 15:13.970
You bitch! You better stop
talking shit like that now!

15:14.070 --> 15:18.070
Hey, watch your back! This bitch can
really kick ass, you know...

15:20.680 --> 15:21.810
U-Ueno!

15:21.950 --> 15:24.110
Who the hell are you, bitch?

15:24.620 --> 15:27.180
I'm a teacher at Shirokin High...

15:27.720 --> 15:30.450
Fobbing off your suspect
goods on my students...

15:30.590 --> 15:32.360
You're gonna pay for this!

15:32.830 --> 15:34.350
Is that right?

15:34.760 --> 15:37.490
Okay! Take this bitch out, guys!

15:39.630 --> 15:41.260
Ojou!

15:41.470 --> 15:44.910
I lost you at the worst possible time!

15:45.040 --> 15:46.300
Ojou!

15:46.670 --> 15:49.910
Where in the world are you? Huh?

15:52.010 --> 15:53.740
Bad omen!

16:01.660 --> 16:04.820
The Nekomata Group's
behind this scam, right?

16:04.990 --> 16:05.720
Crap!

16:05.860 --> 16:08.190
Hey, the jig is up now, lady!

16:10.800 --> 16:13.770
That is, unless you don't care
what happens to this kid!

16:13.870 --> 16:17.800
Found him skulking around outside.
He's with you, isn't he?

16:18.510 --> 16:20.000
Sorry...

16:20.770 --> 16:23.400
He jumped me from behind...

16:23.680 --> 16:27.080
Looks like the tables are turned!

16:28.920 --> 16:30.380
You idiot!

16:30.620 --> 16:34.580
Hey! Is that you, Sawada?

16:34.720 --> 16:36.380
This is great!

16:37.990 --> 16:39.480
Shin Sawada...

16:39.590 --> 16:44.900
They say you've been acting like you're
the shit around school these days.

16:45.130 --> 16:46.360
Kudoh...

16:47.770 --> 16:50.240
So this is how it's going down, Teach.

16:50.340 --> 16:55.140
If you want that student of yours
to be safe, keep your hands to yourself.

16:56.580 --> 16:58.010
All right, fine.

16:58.350 --> 17:00.410
Just don't hurt the kid!

17:00.550 --> 17:05.350
Goddammit, you bitch!
I'm gonna make you pay!

17:08.190 --> 17:09.450
Yamaguchi!

17:10.060 --> 17:13.760
Don't just stand there! Forget about me!
Take these assholes out!

17:13.860 --> 17:15.490
Shut your trap!

17:15.660 --> 17:17.630
I said don't touch him!

17:21.770 --> 17:23.570
All right, it's my turn now.

17:23.700 --> 17:24.430
No way!

17:26.640 --> 17:27.800
Take that!

17:30.640 --> 17:31.700
Cut it out!

17:31.950 --> 17:34.610
Kudoh, you're gonna eat it!

17:35.550 --> 17:36.520
Damn you...

17:36.950 --> 17:37.710
Shin!

17:38.420 --> 17:39.320
Ow!

17:39.650 --> 17:41.180
You piece of crap!

17:41.320 --> 17:44.050
Stop it! I said not to hurt the kid!

17:44.120 --> 17:47.220
Shut up!
I'm gonna kick the crap out of him!

17:49.760 --> 17:50.960
What the hell?

17:56.600 --> 17:59.840
Enough already. Let the kid go.

18:00.370 --> 18:01.210
Tetsu!

18:04.040 --> 18:07.010
I said let him go already, moron!

18:09.420 --> 18:12.110
How'd you know to come here?

18:12.290 --> 18:14.920
It was the boss from Tenkai.
He gave us a call.

18:15.060 --> 18:15.950
Minoru!

18:16.090 --> 18:19.650
He said to come right away, 'cause you were
about to get into some hot water.

18:19.790 --> 18:25.130
We were looking for you when we
spotted Fuji, wandering around nearby.

18:25.330 --> 18:26.630
I'm so ashamed of myself...

18:26.730 --> 18:31.360
My nose isn't working the way it used to.
That's why it took so long.

18:31.510 --> 18:32.910
I see...

18:33.170 --> 18:35.470
You guys really saved my butt this time.

18:37.540 --> 18:39.210
AUGH!

18:39.310 --> 18:41.710
Blood! There's blood on Ojou's face!

18:41.820 --> 18:42.980
What the hell?

18:43.150 --> 18:45.620
All right, who did this?

18:46.650 --> 18:47.850
It was him!

18:48.520 --> 18:51.460
Hey, why are you all so spooked?

18:51.690 --> 18:52.790
Even you, Mr. Miyata!

18:52.890 --> 18:56.420
We still outnumber them, you know!
Come on, let's get them!

18:58.500 --> 19:01.660
Moron, you don't win
fights by sheer numbers.

19:02.640 --> 19:05.400
I'll make you sick of fighting...

19:06.070 --> 19:08.840
...fighting the Ooedo way, that is!

19:09.940 --> 19:11.780
Vengeance is mine!

19:29.030 --> 19:32.090
Are you frickin' kidding me?
She's the Ooedo Clan's Ojou?

19:32.200 --> 19:33.570
That teacher-bitch?

19:33.770 --> 19:36.000
Crap! You just wait!

19:37.200 --> 19:40.270
Hey brat, don't think
you're gonna get away.

19:50.580 --> 19:51.710
Listen up...

19:54.820 --> 19:57.850
If I ever catch you laying a finger on
a Shirokin student's head...

19:57.990 --> 20:00.620
You'll be sorry you were ever BORN!

20:02.460 --> 20:03.620
Do you hear me?

20:03.760 --> 20:08.070
We-we won't ever go near
any Shirokin students again...

20:08.240 --> 20:11.030
And we'll stop crowding Tenkai's turf!

20:13.270 --> 20:16.640
Th-that kid can run!

20:20.410 --> 20:24.610
The asphalt is so cold.
Feels really good!

20:36.360 --> 20:37.160
Shin!

20:41.700 --> 20:45.570
I got you mixed up in this,
and I got you hurt, too...

20:46.140 --> 20:50.340
It was careless of me, but as for you...

20:52.310 --> 20:54.580
If it's just for kicks...

20:58.190 --> 21:02.150
...don't ever butt into my
backdoor operations again!

21:12.930 --> 21:13.900
Crap.

21:17.400 --> 21:18.870
Ow!

21:27.810 --> 21:29.110
Good morning!

21:29.520 --> 21:32.850
Huh? Yankumi,
what happened to your mouth?

21:33.220 --> 21:35.310
Oh, I cut myself, see...

21:35.520 --> 21:36.990
Got into a fight?

21:37.060 --> 21:38.690
Well, something like that.

21:38.830 --> 21:39.880
Time for roll call!

21:40.060 --> 21:43.660
I'll just take a look to see
who's a no-show this morning...

21:48.540 --> 21:49.590
Shin?

22:06.890 --> 22:16.890
<i>We are all born</i>
<i>crying out to the world.</i>

22:17.930 --> 22:27.860
<i>Because of all the endless grief</i>
<i>that we must go through in life.</i>

22:28.640 --> 22:38.350
<i>All of the heartache</i>
<i>is such a heavy load to bear.</i>

22:38.650 --> 22:43.520
<i>On those days when</i>
<i>I am alone and cold...</i>

22:43.760 --> 22:48.700
<i>...I'll light a fire with</i>
<i>my own two hands.</i>

22:49.130 --> 22:54.070
<i>The treacherous mountains</i>
<i>are my chosen path.</i>

22:54.230 --> 23:01.000
<i>I'll keep moving forward</i>
<i>without a backward glance.</i>

23:17.490 --> 23:23.360
If you're a true Edo man, you'll take
a good fight over your daily meals.

23:23.600 --> 23:25.930
Back off, you bottom-feeders!

23:26.100 --> 23:27.620
By the way, Ojou...

23:27.770 --> 23:31.030
I wonder what's up
with that redheaded kid?

23:31.200 --> 23:33.800
Did he catch a cold or something?

23:33.910 --> 23:35.840
Huh? That's not it?

23:36.140 --> 23:39.580
Next episode: Shin Drops Out of School?

23:39.710 --> 23:45.350
There's a story behind
everything and everyone, eh?
